{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@2374","endTime":326783.457,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 12\nAlum-connect.\n\nAn education website presentation combining an online-learning introduction with student service information.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nEducation & services\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nA clear first step into learning.\n\nAlum Connect’s supplied designs introduce an online-learning platform and present services for students. The original artwork includes learning illustrations, a prominent introductory section, and service cards. Only the Alum Connect graphics are included here; unrelated screenshots embedded in the legacy page are excluded.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Alum-connect's original project material.\n\n01\nLearning introduction\n\nThe hero presents the platform’s education-oriented proposition.\n\n02\nStudent services\n\nThe supplied layout includes distinct cards for student-facing services.\n\n03\nInformation hierarchy\n\nHeadline, supporting text, and service panels establish separate reading levels.\n\n04\nAccount navigation\n\nA sign-in entry appears within the public website header.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nEducation & services\n\nAqua presentation colors, white sections, and blue-and-pink service tiles give the interface a light educational character. The visual hierarchy moves from the headline and illustration to focused service modules.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Alum-connect.\n\nExplore the original design compositions. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nAlum-connect's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nAlum-connect / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nKegelklock\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nEXERCISE & WELLBEING\nKegelklock\nSPORTS & COACHING\nBR-tennis\nMORTGAGE & FINANCE\nNetwork Capital\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
